  <data name="Info_AutoAdmin_Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Some files can only be read with administrator rights. It’s what happens when File Explorer says “You need permission to perform this action”.\n• Xbox or Microsoft Store games: their .exe files are protected by Windows.\n• Folders of other users on this PC or of Windows.\nMegaCopier copies everything else and, at the end, asks for permission only once for those files. If you say no, they stay marked with their error and you can retry with “Copy as administrator”.</value></data>
